@startuml UML-SYNCHRONIZATION-FLOW
title KnowledgeOS — Personal State Synchronization Flow
caption Architecture V3.0 — iCloud / CloudKit Profile

skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor User
participant "Apple Device A" as A
database "Local Personal State A" as StateA
participant "Sync Engine A" as SyncA
participant "iCloud / CloudKit" as Cloud
participant "Sync Engine B" as SyncB
database "Local Personal State B" as StateB
participant "Apple Device B" as B

User -> A : Create annotation or update progress
A -> StateA : Persist personal change
A -> SyncA : Schedule personal-state synchronization
SyncA -> Cloud : Upload governed personal-state change
Cloud --> SyncA : Acknowledge accepted change

Cloud -> SyncB : Deliver remote personal-state change
SyncB -> StateB : Reconcile and persist
SyncB --> B : Personal state updated

note over A, B
  Publication payload acquisition is not part of this flow.
  The NAS Master Library is not a personal-state sync peer.
end note

footer KnowledgeOS Architecture | UML | Version 3.0
@enduml
